		{"id":"f806ca36a320f07f","type":"text","text":"\n## **08:15** -\tMini test Lessonup\n## **08:20** - Extra Instruction or Creative Exercise\n## **08:50** - Kwizl classroom\n","x":-324,"y":-107,"width":649,"height":155,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ef7b5996f88ad312","type":"text","text":"# **Today's Class**","x":-113,"y":-185,"width":218,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"afe4f452fe2c3477","x":-318,"y":73,"width":501,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"## **Kwizl Code** : *Z4LPT9*"},
		{"id":"5b86f5db4c9d58cc","type":"file","file":"Lessen/VWO 2/Lesplannen/Week 44/Test Instructions; Chapter 1.md","x":-318,"y":166,"width":511,"height":635,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6d067b4fa9bb0462","x":517,"y":-107,"width":683,"height":826,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"## Creative Task: Create a Mini Chapter 1 Test in groups of 2-3 \n\nYou are now the teacher.\n\nCreate a **mini test for your classmates on paper** about Chapter 1. Your test should be challenging, but fair.\n\n### Your mini test must contain 10 questions\n\n- **2 Past simple questions**\n- **2 Past continuous questions**\n- **2 Past simple vs. past continuous questions**\n- **2 Irregular verb questions**\n- **1 Vocabulary question**\n- **1 Holiday/Stones question**\n\n### Make it creative\n\nDo not only write fill-in-the-blank questions. Use at least **3 different question types**, for example:\n\n- Fill in the correct verb\n- Correct the mistake\n- Multiple choice\n- Translate a word\n- Finish a sentence\n- Write a question based on a picture or situation\n- Give two sentences and ask which one is correct\n- Create a short holiday story with missing words"},
		{"id":"df6b2383cdb65cc2","x":1336,"y":-107,"width":590,"height":351,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"### Grammar\n\n- **Past simple**: finished actions in the past  \n    _We went to the beach yesterday._\n- **Past continuous**: actions that were in progress in the past  \n    _We were swimming at 3 p.m._\n- **Past simple + past continuous**: use the past continuous for the longer action and the past simple for the shorter event  \n    _I was walking home when it started to rain._\n- Know the required **irregular verbs**, especially their past simple forms."},
		{"id":"263fa433587f39a9","x":1414,"y":306,"width":512,"height":254,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"### What you should be able to do\n\n- choose between **past simple** and **past continuous**\n- use common **irregular past verbs**\n- understand and use the Chapter 1 vocabulary\n- describe a **past holiday**\n- explain what happened during the holiday"},
		{"id":"9a594e369a974ed9","x":2040,"y":-107,"width":725,"height":1677,"color":"6","type":"text","text":"## 1. Past simple\n\nComplete the sentences with the correct past simple form.\n\n1. We ___ (go) to Spain last summer.\n2. She ___ (buy) a new suitcase.\n3. They ___ (stay) at a campsite.\n4. I ___ (take) lots of pictures.\n5. He ___ (see) a beautiful rainbow.\n\n## 2. Past continuous\n\nComplete the sentences with **was/were + verb-ing**.\n\n1. I ___ (pack) my suitcase at 8 p.m.\n2. They ___ (swim) in the sea.\n3. She ___ (read) a travel guide.\n4. We ___ (walk) through the city.\n5. He ___ (sleep) when I called.\n\n## 3. Past simple or past continuous?\n\nChoose the correct tense.\n\n1. I ___ (walk) to the hotel when it ___ (start) to rain.\n2. They ___ (sunbathe) when they ___ (hear) thunder.\n3. We ___ (drive) home when we ___ (see) an accident.\n4. She ___ (take) a picture while her friends ___ (swim).\n5. I ___ (sleep) when my alarm ___ (ring).\n\n## 4. Irregular verbs\n\nWrite the past simple form.\n\n1. go → ___\n2. see → ___\n3. take → ___\n4. buy → ___\n5. come → ___\n6. have → ___\n7. make → ___\n8. get → ___\n9. eat → ___\n10. drink → ___\n\n## 5. Vocabulary\n\nTranslate into English.\n\n1. bestemming → ___\n2. bagage → ___\n3. zonnebrandcrème → ___\n4. regenjas → ___\n5. rugzak → ___\n6. bezienswaardigheden bezoeken → ___\n7. een fiets huren → ___\n8. zonnebril → ___\n9. bewolkt → ___\n10. hittegolf → ___"},
		{"id":"722ce0fe868f6723","x":2961,"y":-107,"width":250,"height":1166,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"**1. Past simple:**\n\n1. went\n2. bought\n3. stayed\n4. took\n5. saw\n\n**2. Past continuous:**\n\n1. was packing\n2. were swimming\n3. was reading\n4. were walking\n5. was sleeping\n\n**3. Mixed:**\n\n1. was walking / started\n2. were sunbathing / heard\n3. were driving / saw\n4. took / were swimming\n5. was sleeping / rang\n\n**4. Irregular verbs:**  \nwent, saw, took, bought, came, had, made, got, ate, drank\n\n**5. Vocabulary:**\n\n1. destination\n2. luggage\n3. sunscreen\n4. raincoat\n5. backpack\n6. go sightseeing\n7. rent a bike\n8. sunglasses\n9. cloudy\n10. heatwave"}
	],
